From: Himess <semihcvlk53@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:44:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] test(sdk): re-point the cleartext mock's ACL at the
 lifecycle ACL v0.4.2 (Level 2)

The vendored v0.13.0 host stack's ACL.sol and ACLEvents.sol become
byte-identical copies of host-contracts/contracts/{ACL,ACLEvents}.sol on
this branch: ACL v0.4.2, the v0.13-line backport with the lifecycle Core
and the E1 successor extension. CleartextACL inherits it unchanged, so the
mock's decryption views follow retirement and succession. Test-only, as
the Level 0 mock branch did for ACL v0.4.1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
